{"unit_id":"daha1216__dsh-pocket#feature-1","repo":"daha1216/dsh-pocket","commit":"2b56c46d24ceebbaf5dd81c437de8095aae3dc44","type":"feature","lang":"zh","text":"dsh-pocket 的功能「局域网扫码连接」：插件启动本机代理后，在手机访问设置页展示局域网地址和二维码；手机连接同一网络即可打开电脑上的 DSH Web 页面并实时查看会话。","source":"generated","evidence":["lib/service.mjs:180-208","client/index.jsx:286-353"]}
{"unit_id":"daha1216__dsh-pocket#feature-2","repo":"daha1216/dsh-pocket","commit":"2b56c46d24ceebbaf5dd81c437de8095aae3dc44","type":"feature","lang":"zh","text":"dsh-pocket 的功能「固定域名远程访问」：用户保存自己的 Cloudflare 命名隧道域名与 Token 后，可从设置页启动公网通道并显示连接二维码；未完成配置时不能启动该通道。","source":"generated","evidence":["lib/settings.mjs:460-480","lib/service.mjs:437-457"]}
{"unit_id":"daha1216__dsh-pocket#feature-3","repo":"daha1216/dsh-pocket","commit":"2b56c46d24ceebbaf5dd81c437de8095aae3dc44","type":"feature","lang":"zh","text":"dsh-pocket 的功能「手机界面适配」：客户端在移动端应用抽屉式布局和触控适配，让 DSH 页面更适合窄屏操作；设置页还提供手机侧栏、捏合缩放和字号偏好。","source":"generated","evidence":["client/mobile/mobile-apply.tsx:1-18","client/index.jsx:1238-1255"]}
{"unit_id":"daha1216__dsh-pocket#feature-4","repo":"daha1216/dsh-pocket","commit":"2b56c46d24ceebbaf5dd81c437de8095aae3dc44","type":"feature","lang":"zh","text":"dsh-pocket 的功能「命令行启动访问代理」：用户可运行 dsh-pocket 启动局域网代理，也可指定代理端口；支持读取已保存的固定域名隧道配置以启动公网访问。","source":"generated","evidence":["bin/dsh-pocket.mjs:1-18","bin/dsh-pocket.mjs:155-180"]}
{"unit_id":"daha1216__dsh-pocket#caveat-1","repo":"daha1216/dsh-pocket","commit":"2b56c46d24ceebbaf5dd81c437de8095aae3dc44","type":"caveat","lang":"zh","text":"dsh-pocket 使用前须知：手机访问依赖电脑上的 DSH Web 已运行；公网访问需要自行配置 Cloudflare 固定域名和 Tunnel Token，局域网扫码无需这项公网配置。","source":"generated","evidence":["lib/service.mjs:180-198","lib/settings.mjs:460-480"]}
{"unit_id":"daha1216__dsh-pocket#caveat-2","repo":"daha1216/dsh-pocket","commit":"2b56c46d24ceebbaf5dd81c437de8095aae3dc44","type":"caveat","lang":"zh","text":"dsh-pocket 使用前须知：插件将偏好和隧道配置保存在 DSH_HOME 下的 dsh-pocket/settings.json；未设置 DSH_HOME 时使用用户目录中的 .dsh。","source":"generated","evidence":["lib/settings.mjs:18-32"]}
